### Global CSS

To customize the Tooltip component classes, you can use the `@layer components` directive.
[Learn more](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/adding-custom-styles#adding-component-classes).

```css
@layer components {
  .tooltip {
    @apply rounded-xl shadow-lg;
  }

  .tooltip__trigger {
    @apply cursor-help;
  }
}
```

